# Harklight

Harklight delivers this agent's questions and notices to the person's Harklight
inbox (iPhone app or web) and returns their answers. This computer is connected
by `harklight-agent setup`. After setup, the `harklight-agent` command needs no
connection options. Run `harklight-agent setup` with no arguments to see the
Server, account and sender IDs this computer may use. If it reports that this
computer is disconnected, tell the person. Connecting needs their invitation
and approval.

Use a sender ID this computer is granted. The setup default grant `app:agent/`
covers any ID that begins with it, such as `app:agent/claude-code` or
`app:agent/codex`. `--display-name` sets the name the person sees.

